{"description": "An anthropomorphic pizza slice with a cheerful expression, featuring a golden crust, red tomato sauce spots, and brown cheese patches, standing upright with arms raised. The crust is brown with a slight gradient, and the slice has small orange and yellow spots representing melted cheese. Two pink tomato sauce circles are visible on either side of the pizza's 'face', which includes two large white eyes with black pupils, small orange eyebrows, and an open pink mouth showing white teeth. Black lines represent arms and legs extending from the sides and bottom of the slice. The entire image has a white background.", "detail": "The image depicts a single anthropomorphized pizza slice. The crust is brown with a gradient effect, forming the base and sides of the slice. The main body of the pizza is golden, adorned with two prominent pink tomato sauce spots on each side near the top. Scattered across the surface are orange and yellow spots suggesting melted cheese. The pizza slice has a face with two large white eyes, each with black pupils, and small orange eyebrows. The mouth is open, pink inside, displaying white teeth. Extending from the sides are black arms raised upwards, and from the bottom are black legs positioned as if the slice is standing. The entire scene is set against a plain white background, emphasizing the vibrant colors of the pizza slice.", "instruction": "An anthropomorphic pizza slice with a cheerful expression, featuring a golden crust, red tomato sauce spots, and brown cheese patches, standing upright with arms raised. The crust is brown with a slight gradient, and the slice has small orange and yellow spots representing melted cheese. Two pink tomato sauce circles are visible on either side of the pizza's 'face', which includes two large white eyes with black pupils, small orange eyebrows, and an open pink mouth showing white teeth. Black lines represent arms and legs extending from the sides and bottom of the slice. The entire image has a white background.", "instruction_source": "description", "metadata": {"canonical_svg_sha256": "19826ddaa36e2cfa47d32be51f555c1940e481064da8433dc540069774d77447", "caption_sha256": "117cb1d8888812b540c5a065b46e0adc268af78371b42650d5cc5f189f76951b", "dataset_id": "OmniSVG/MMSVG-Illustration", "dataset_revision": "6d81c98ae9bc1f4e1fca80cea496a73cb7f150c1", "dataset_type": "illustration", "description_words": 101, "detail_sha256": "52428d1bde9701140f5defe585b5b8f7a11a24361d137f0ad4d1764fef944f8d", "detail_words": 127, "full_chat_token_length": 36108, "instruction_policy": {"r0_description_only": "description", "r1_detail_60_description_40": "detail", "r2_detail_only": "detail"}, "record_id": "499e99a7acbf6251fa41baf78fd3e09f", "retrieved_item_ids": [], "source_pointer": {"file": "/data/minjun_dev/mmsvg_raw/mmsvg_illustration_v2/data/train-00009-of-00026.parquet", "row": 829}, "split": "train", "stable_record_key_sha256": "06197527aadf9b8fa1d52f37347637adb342e8f12850e42f66e60d3001ac2d8a", "svg_char_length": 38009, "svg_element_count": 56, "svg_path_command_count": 507, "svg_path_count": 55, "svg_token_length": 35526}, "official_discrete_audit": {"codec_tokens": 2043, "framed_target_tokens": 2043, "full_chat_tokens": 2286, "labeled_tokens": 2043, "line_number": 11973, "maximum_observed_id": 307205, "record_id": "499e99a7acbf6251fa41baf78fd3e09f", "split": "train", "target_ids_sha256": "4be56c185e39b8304c7606e0eb543582fe7241485b923e648000afec8e342a34"}, "output_svg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" height=\"200.0px\" viewBox=\"0.0 0.0 200.0 200.0\" width=\"200.0px\"><path d=\"M155.6925811767578 76.1019515991211 C138.18399047851562 89.6382827758789 132.01329040527344 105.759765625 131.75936889648438 106.43944549560547 L133.55743408203125 107.11210632324219 C133.61798095703125 106.95039367675781 139.8132781982422 90.8050765991211 156.8664093017578 77.6207046508789 L155.6925811767578 76.1019515991211 Z\" fill=\"#6d260f\" fill-opacity=\"1.0\" filling=\"0\"><